su name import be map def
  su name default ob text "" ya
  su name photograph ob text "first analyze the photograph directly with your own photograph capability if available; if direct analysis is unavailable, call be see from filename on the saved photograph path" ya
  su name documentation ob text "" ya
  su name audio ob text "" ya
  su name text ob text "" ya
  su name file ob text "" ya
  su name read tool ob text "be read from filename <path> ... : extract text from documentation/audio/photograph via read auto" ya
  su name see tool ob text "be see from filename <photograph> ... : ask a photograph-capable mind directly" ya
  su name command tool ob text "be command ... : inspect/process files" ya
  su name repair tool ob text "be repair ... : patch code/text files safely" ya
prah
